{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46977","headline":"招湖上兄弟 · 齐己","name":"招湖上兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁得君消息在，两凭人信过重湖。\n忍贪风月当年少，不寄音书慰老夫。\n药鼎近闻传秘诀，诗门曾说拥寒炉。\n汉江江路西来便，好傍扁舟访我无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}